      "title": "Dynatrace OAuth",
      "type": "object",
      "x-credential-instructions": "Connect your Dynatrace account using OAuth. Enter the account UUID from Account Management. The OAuth client must allow the account-management permissions needed by these operations and openid, profile and offline_access for identity and refresh. The user must also have the corresponding account permissions. Register the NoClick callback URL with the client. Classic environment API tokens do not grant Account Management access.",
